Third-party assets bundled in this repository are covered by their own terms:

  frontend/public/models/engine.bin.gz
    Derived from "Turbine | Turbofan Engine | Jet Engine" by blenderbirb
    (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/turbine-turbofan-engine-jet-engine-74c6aceed86b4a41aaad3b93afc3e262)
    licensed under CC BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

  Aircraft, radar and landing-gear meshes are used for visualisation purposes.

Telemetry data is drawn from the NASA Prognostics Center of Excellence C-MAPSS
dataset, which is in the public domain:
  https://data.nasa.gov/dataset/cmapss-jet-engine-simulated-data